  "id": 8058067714110,
  "title": "Quechua 2 Second Easy Fresh & Black Waterproof Pop Up Camping Tent - 2 Person",
  "handle": "quechua-2-second-easy-fresh-black-waterproof-pop-up-camping-tent-2-person",
  "body_html": "<p>Last-minute plans? This 2-person pop-up tent pitches in minutes\u2014perfect for quick setups and easy mobility.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy assembly/dismantling</strong>: Free-standing structure. EASY pitching &amp; folding exclusive patented technology.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Capacity</strong>: 205 x 145 cm bedroom Max. useful height: 110cm.\n2 shoe storage areas.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy to transport</strong>: Dimensions of the bag: 59x20x20 cm / 23.6 L. Weight: 4.7 kg.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Heat resistant</strong>: Flysheet, mechanical air vents, Fresh &amp; Black fabric for a good night's sleep.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Blackout</strong>: FRESH &amp; BLACK patented exterior fabric: 99% darkness even in broad daylight.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Wind resistance</strong>: Resists winds of 50km/h (Force 6): validated in wind tunnels on rotating plate.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Waterproof</strong>: Waterproofing (Schmerber): Flysheet &gt; 2000 mm. Groundsheet &gt; 5000 mm rating.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Note: Sleeping width: up to 27.6\" per person.</em></p>",
