  "body_html": "<p>This model in our 2 Seconds iconic range lets you set up your sleeping space in no time. A guide system makes folding it up again easier.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy to use</strong>: Self-supporting structure. 2 Seconds Editing. Guided folding system.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Capacity</strong>: Bedroom 120 x 210 cm. Max height useful: 99 cm.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy to handle</strong>: Cover size: \u00d874x10 cm / 43 L. Weight: 4 kg.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Heat resistant</strong>: Double roof, mechanical ventilation and Fresh &amp; Black fabric for a good night's</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Blackout</strong>: Thanks to its patented fabric that blocks sunlight</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Wind resistance</strong>: Wind resistance 50 km/h (Force 6): validated in a wind tunnel on a turntable.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Waterproof</strong>: Waterproofing (Schmerber): Flysheet &gt; 2000 mm. Groundsheet &gt; 2400mm.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Note: Sleeping width: max. 60 cm  per person.</em></p>",
